Use the upstream Mesa GBM backend only for AMD, preserve Google's platform-facing C++ layout,
and forward cursor/linear usage and FD ownership correctly. Google's allocator/mapper services
stay unchanged. Based on the same-source fixes in the reference Churro port.
Drop individual hunks when LineageOS minigbm contains them; the layout field is needed while
Google's prebuilt clients use the Android 17 cros_gralloc_driver layout.

